        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "Behold, when it was whole, it was suitable for no work. How much less, when the fire has devoured it, and it has been burned, will it yet be suitable for any work?”",
      "ko": "그것이 온전할 때에도 아무 제조에 합당치 않았거든 하물며 불에 살라지고 탄 후에 어찌 제조에 합당하겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "1e0b6eaa050634c82b81f862370cfa92038d3922543834c346de288e18093ace",
      "translation_text_hash": "a39e1bc39f2a99aa409f4c742119b1f2aeae2884b1947780ff557f1204a00a7c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그것이 온전할 때에도 아무 제조에 합당치 않았거든 하물며 불에 살라지고 탄 후에 어찌 제조에 합당하겠느냐"
